      "oldBinding": "{\"workspace\":\"/Users/yuhan/.cat-cafe/acceptance-receipts/2026-11-23-dsh-team-alpha2-372/mac-package-6073588-alpha2-multi-role/tmp/dsh-native-multi-role-j8Ek1Z/workspace\",\"template\":{\"template_schema\":\"dsh-team-template/1\",\"template_meta\":{\"live_verified\":false,\"notes\":\"Editable two-role base example. Unconfigured current-session defaults add registered file/search/shell/skill tools from the Host; explicit and saved tool lists are kept exact. Startup prompt is one-time input; persona_prompt persists in the role AgentPreset. Tool visibility grants no native permission, model budget or live acceptance.\"},\"version\":1,\"name\":\"preset-team-example\",\"max_members\":4,\"members\":[{\"name\":\"implementer\",\"description\":\"实现角色：认领并推进任务，交付可验证的结果\",\"prompt\":\"Confirm ready and stop.\",\"persona_prompt\":\"你是 implementer。围绕团队任务板与消息协作：认领任务、使用本角色实际可用且原生权限允许的工具推进工作，把结果与验证证据写回任务板并及时同步。结论只基于实际检查，不虚报成功；没查完就说没查完。涉及文件或终端时遵守工作区、沙箱和审批；缺少工具时报告具体缺口，不宣称未配置的能力。\",\"agent_preset\":\"dsh-current-1b6b3d6574143df321674361-implementer\",\"provider\":\"isolated-provider\",\"model\":\"implementer-model\",\"reasoning_effort\":\"max\",\"native_tool_allowlist\":[\"team_task_get\",\"team_task_update\"]},{\"name\":\"reviewer\",\"description\":\"复核角色：独立审查结果，给证据绑定的裁定\",\"prompt\":\"Confirm ready and stop.\",\"persona_prompt\":\"你是 reviewer。使用本角色实际可用且原生权限允许的工具独立复核实现交付，逐项对照任务书、源码、测试及任务记录，将结论绑定可复查的证据。裁定用 P0/P1/P2 分级并给可执行的修复要求；不做人情确认，不把作者自述当独立验证。缺少读取或验证工具时标注证据不足，不臆断；遵守工作区、沙箱和审批。\",\"agent_preset\":\"dsh-current-1b6b3d6574143df321674361-reviewer\",\"provider\":\"isolated-provider\",\"model\":\"reviewer-model\",\"reasoning_effort\":\"max\",\"native_tool_allowlist\":[\"team_task_get\",\"team_task_update\"]}],\"seed_tasks\":[{\"key\":\"implement-work-item\",\"subject\":\"实现当前工作项并自验\",\"description\":\"收到明确任务书后，由 implementer 使用已配置的任务板与消息能力推进工作，写回实际结果及证据；需要未配置的文件或shell能力时报告缺口。\",\"owner\":\"implementer\"},{\"key\":\"review-work-item\",\"subject\":\"独立复核 work item 的实现交